// Tag vocabulary. Every tag a rule mentions must appear here, because an
// undeclared tag is the silent no-op this language exists to prevent.
//
// Bits are handed out by prefix at declaration time, so all of trained.flight.*
// lands on one contiguous run and a wildcard clause compiles to a single mask.
// A prefix group is reserved whole, which makes the group size a per-prefix
// content limit as well as the global one.

tag  training.begun

tag  trained.flight.hover
tag  trained.flight.endurance

tag  trained.aura.sustain

tag  trained.gravity.tier1

tag  seen.firstAscension
